# Docs-site toolchain (mkdocs + the API-reference generator).
#
#   pip install -r requirements-docs.in \
#     --extra-index-url https://fractalyze.github.io/pypi/simple/
#
# mkdocstrings *imports* zorch to read signatures and docstrings, so the build
# needs the runtime stack too — the CPU tier is enough (no CUDA plugins), which
# keeps the docs job light. frx/zk-dtypes ride the same pins as
# requirements.in; bump them together.
